> **[FILL IN]** — One paragraph: client name (or anonymized handle), the integration/automation in scope, the systems involved, and the FDE ticket reference. Example: "AlayaCare ↔ [Client] integration via Make.com + Lambda. In scope: client demographic sync, visit data flow, billing reconciliation. FDE ticket: FDE-XXXX."

